@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-03
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-03 BDD\nSysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed\nTest, Observation, Analysis, Diagnosis, Selection, Evidence as separate blocks

class Test {
  t in T(qk)
  cost(t) >= cmin
}
class Observation {
  Izk
  qk observable summary
  ERROR if instrument invalid
}
class Analysis {
  constraint verdict
  same partitions as scoring
}
class Diagnosis {
  Hk candidate set
  compatibility update
}
class Selection {
  one-step minimax s(t)
  Prep action
}
class Evidence {
  traces
  stop class
  budget remainder
}

Test --> Observation : execute
Observation --> Analysis : Izk
Analysis --> Diagnosis : compatible / inconsistent
Diagnosis --> Selection : remaining Hk
Selection --> Test : next test or stop
Evidence ..> Observation
Evidence ..> Diagnosis
Evidence ..> Selection
note bottom
  Blocks are logical SysML classifiers, not implemented modules.
end note
@enduml
